    "body": "Thanks, that seems reasonable.\n\nThe original motivation to require `src` was to act as fallback for UAs that don't support `srcset` or `picture`. Now we have made the call that it's no longer needed, `srcset` on `img` is supported across browsers and search engines.\n\n`picture` is supported across browsers, too, but I don't know the situation with search engines. We can file bugs though. cc @foolip\n\nhttps://www.12gobiking.nl/winkel has \n```\n<picture>\n    <source type=\"image/webp\" preload-image=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.12gobiking.nl/media/fit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.12gobiking.nl%2Fmedia%2Fcms%2F2024%2Fwinkel%2F12GO_PANDEN.jpg&amp;width=1200&amp;height=1000&amp;quality=80&amp;type=webp\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\">\n    <source type=\"image/jpeg\" preload-image=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.12gobiking.nl/media/fit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.12gobiking.nl%2Fmedia%2Fcms%2F2024%2Fwinkel%2F12GO_PANDEN.jpg&amp;width=1200&amp;height=1000&amp;quality=80&amp;type=jpeg\" media=\"(min-width: 768px)\">\n    <source type=\"image/webp\" preload-image=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.12gobiking.nl/media/fit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.12gobiking.nl%2Fmedia%2Fcms%2F2024%2Fwinkel%2F12GO_PANDEN.jpg&amp;width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;quality=80&amp;type=webp\" media=\"(max-width: 767px)\">\n    <source type=\"image/jpeg\" preload-image=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.12gobiking.nl/media/fit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.12gobiking.nl%2Fmedia%2Fcms%2F2024%2Fwinkel%2F12GO_PANDEN.jpg&amp;width=1000&amp;height=1000&amp;quality=80&amp;type=jpeg\" media=\"(max-width: 767px)\">\n    <img alt=\"Fietsenwinkel 12GO Biking\" loading=\"eager\" class=\"\" width=\"1667\" height=\"389\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1667 / 389\">\n  </picture>\n```\nI don't see this image in [Google image search](https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv=340a42e2eabdb65d&q=%22Fietsenwinkel+12GO+Biking%22+site:https://www.12gobiking.nl&udm=2&fbs=ABzOT_CWdhQLP1FcmU5B0fn3xuWpl9TJhFpv10NgaL-T8u3cGh2V3Qmk96AdC4hnNK5oN7IbMAjLo4Id3jDeTJ7qcfzgAH_-xP4uupN-7bLvDBLYIzCzVtt_nzb8R7n8tCSpxYbqoBKTWPwCH8JPDUlMEIwc5PtO1Op790SnrAc7bLEN-wIk-XlONjsu1uegbgPq1QKZW4ax&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjgv8b2oLSNAxXVExAIHeXwAGEQtKgLegQIExAB&biw=1593&bih=1735&dpr=2) nor [Bing image search](https://www.bing.com/images/search?q=%22Fietsenwinkel+12GO+Biking%22+site%3ahttps%3a%2f%2fwww.12gobiking.nl&form=HDRSC3&first=1).\n\nSee [httparchive query results](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1o_rCoG-q17bxqP5e1Of9JnK6Vtm0yjQfyE2VoDSxn3E/edit?usp=sharing).",
