    "body": "@foolip I can try 😅\n\nI'll start off with some WPT-tests that proves that it works right now.\n\nThere is one issue with the [complete getter steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#dom-img-complete) though. They return early if both `src` and `srcset` is empty, so those will have to be updated. Otherwise I haven't encountered any issues omitting `src` and `srcset` on the `<img>` element.\n\nI have filed a separate issue for this: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9346.\n\n",
