    "body": "> [@johannesodland](https://github.com/johannesodland) do you want to try to create a pull request for this change and some tests that proves that it already works?\n\n@foolip I did just read through the [contributors agreement](https://participate.whatwg.org/agreement), and it looks like I am not allowed to contribute as an individual contributor as I work in the field of web development. That means I have to convince my employer to sign so that I can contribute through them as an entity. That is a whole different ballgame. I will give it a try though :) ",
